Usage: nimbu channels entries gallery remove --channel=STRING --entry=STRING --field=STRING --image-id=IMAGE-ID,... [flags]

Remove gallery images (requires --force)

Flags:
      --channel=STRING           Channel ID or slug
      --entry=STRING             Entry ID or slug
      --field=STRING             Gallery field name
      --image-id=IMAGE-ID,...    Gallery image ID to remove (repeatable)
      --locale=STRING            Content locale for localized channel fields

Safety:
      --force                    Skip confirmations for destructive operations
      --dry-run                  Print the payload without updating the entry

Global Flags:
  -h, --help                     Show context-sensitive help.
      --env=STRING               Named project environment (overrides site and
                                 API URL)
      --site=STRING              Site ID or subdomain, else nimbu.yml site
                                 ($NIMBU_SITE)
      --json                     Output JSON to stdout ($NIMBU_JSON)
      --plain                    Output stable TSV to stdout ($NIMBU_PLAIN)
      --verbose                  Enable verbose logging
      --debug                    Enable debug logging (HTTP traces)
      --version                  Print version and exit

Run "nimbu channels entries gallery remove --help-all" for all flags.
